{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalBlockEquality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalBlockEquality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SytInsertMaxTransport","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalBlockTrace","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_seminormalRep_heckeIncl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_seminormalRep_heckeIncl","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L164-L194","doc":"**Step 2, first half.**  The compression of the big seminormal representation, along the\ninclusion, IS the small seminormal representation — for every element, not just the generators. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_mul","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L138-L162","doc":"**Compression is multiplicative on block-preserving matrices.**  The sum over `SYT μ` collapses\nto a sum over the block, and the block is exactly `insertMax`'s image. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_smul","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L134-L136","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress_one","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L125-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.compress","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L118-L123","doc":"Restriction of a matrix to the block of the corner `c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.exists_insertMax_of_cellOf_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.exists_insertMax_of_cellOf_top","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L101-L108","doc":"…and conversely the block of `c` is exactly the image of `insertMax`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.cellOf_insertMax_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.cellOf_insertMax_top","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L93-L99","doc":"The inserted entry sits at `c`: `insertMax` lands in the block of the corner `c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.genMat_insertMax","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.genMat_insertMax","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalBlockEquality.lean#L54-L91","doc":"**The block equality.**  A generator that avoids the top entry has, on the block of the corner\n`c`, exactly the matrix it has downstairs on `μ ∖ c`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}